    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Prime Minister Shehbaz Sharif has called for coordinated efforts among all stakeholders to eradicate Hepatitis C from Pakistan, emphasizing the urgency of addressing this major public health challenge. He made these remarks during a recognition ceremony celebrating the successful completion of the pilot phase of the PM's National Hepatitis C Elimination Programme in Gilgit-Baltistan (GB).",
